{"a":[108,108],"h":"<p>108.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 27.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de ki-her kim esası ve her salâhın başı olan ma'bud mes'elesinde <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"144\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 143.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 35.3 35.3 51.0 62.3 62.3 62.3 74.3 82.6 82.6 98.3 105.0 114.0 114.0 120.7 120.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 27.7 105.0 114.0 127.6\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bana ancak şöyle vahy olunuyor: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"190\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 189.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 44.3 61.6 61.6 68.3 68.3 75.7 75.7 91.6 91.6 100.6 100.6 112.6 112.6 120.7 120.7 128.3 128.3 144.0 144.0 150.7 159.7 159.7 166.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 150.7 159.7 166.6 173.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hepinizin ilâhı ancak bir ilâhdır ki-Allahdır. Balâda isbat olunduğu üzere maadası batıldır.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"159\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.0 63.0 63.0 78.8 78.8 87.8 87.8 94.6 94.6 101.3 117.0 117.0 127.6 135.8\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 51.0 101.3 127.6 135.8 142.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Binaenaleyh sizin buna islâmınız var mı? -Bu vahyi teslim edip kemali ıhlâs ile hepiniz bir ilâha inkıyadı kabul ediyor musunuz? </p>"}